C["ENV_CH03-INT-004_THE_FORGOTTEN_KITCHEN_V001.jpg"] = "Interior of a stone-walled kitchen in dim grey light. A stone hearth with two arched openings holds a black cooking pot and a copper basin on top, with logs in the openings. Bunches of dried herbs hang from the upper wall at left, a niche shelf holds a jar, a round grinding stone sits on a low stone base at centre-right, a wicker basket stands nearby, a wooden table stands at right with bowls, and an open doorway at the back right leads to a long corridor. A gap in the wall at centre shows rock and light outside."
